       <SPAN class=3D"k">ELSE</SPAN>  <SPAN class=3D"c">! This is an =
error condition which should be handled - for now just truncate</SPAN>=0A=
          <SPAN class=3D"n">ctot</SPAN> <SPAN class=3D"o">=3D</SPAN> =
<SPAN class=3D"n">s1</SPAN><SPAN class=3D"p">%</SPAN><SPAN =
